urring a texture: with full seamless protection,\nwith none, and with the Moon blur node's built-in wrap mode.\n\n\nThe RepeatImageBatch + ImageGrid combo tiles each result 2×2 so any seam becomes visible at a glance."},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":40,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[670,90],"size":[380,175],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Branch A — Full seamless sandwich","properties":{},"widgets_values":["Moisan periodic+smooth decomposition isolates the periodic component, then CircularPad / CircularUnpad wraps a non-tiling-aware Gaussian blur so the edges stay seamless despite the filter itself having no wrap awareness. \n\n\nAny number of non-tiling-aware filters (blur, sharpen, any convolution-based node) can be stacked between CircularPad and CircularUnpad in the same\nsandwich — the padding only needs to be applied once at the start and removed once at the end."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"Moisan periodic+smooth decomposition isolates the periodic component, then CircularPad / CircularUnpad wraps a non-tiling-aware Gaussian blur so the edges stay seamless despite the filter itself having no wrap awareness. \n\n\nAny number of non-tiling-aware filters (blur, sharpen, any convolution-based node) can be stacked between CircularPad and CircularUnpad in the same\nsandwich — the padding only needs to be applied once at the start and removed once at the end."},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":41,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1510,585],"size":[355,130],"flags":{},"order":3,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Branch B — Naive blur (control / baseline)","properties":{},"widgets_values":["Same Gaussian blur applied directly to the raw image, no decomposition, no padding. \n\nExpected to show visible seams at the tile borders in the 2×2 grid — this is the failure case Branch A is meant to fix."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"Same Gaussian blur applied directly to the raw image, no decomposition, no padding. \n\nExpected to show visible seams at the tile borders in the 2×2 grid — this is the failure case Branch A is meant to fix."},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":42,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[1520,1125],"size":[355,130],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Branch C — MoonImageBlur built-in wrap_mode","properties":{},"widgets_values":["Tests the Moon pack's own blur node, which claims seamless tiling without needing an external CircularPad/Unpad sandwich when wrap_mode=\"circular\"."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"Tests the Moon pack's own blur node, which claims seamless tiling without needing an external CircularPad/Unpad sandwich when wrap_mode=\"circular\"."},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"}],"links":[[17,4,0,3,0,"IMAGE"],[18,3,0,24,0,"IMAGE"],[19,24,0,23,0,"IMAGE"],[20,23,0,25,0,"IMAGE"],[21,24,1,25,1,"INT"],[22,24,2,25,2,"INT"],[24,4,0,28,0,"IMAGE"],[26,25,0,30,0,"IMAGE"],[27,30,0,29,0,"IMAGE"],[29,29,0,27,0,"IMAGE"],[30,33,0,32,0,"IMAGE"],[31,28,0,33,0,"IMAGE"],[32,32,0,27,1,"IMAGE"],[33,4,0,34,0,"IMAGE"],[34,36,0,35,0,"IMAGE"],[35,34,0,36,0,"IMAGE"],[36,35,0,37,0,"IMAGE"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":1.1712800000000128,"offset":[161.5765689221305,-178.1627841634936]}},"version":0.4}